{
  "product": "Infoblox DDI (NIOS / Universal DDI)",
  "source_documentation": {
    "note": "Compiled from data supplied directly by the repository maintainer, covering three distinct places Infoblox NIOS/Universal DDI categorizes its own log output: the Grid-wide Syslog Forwarding category list, the separately-configured DNS Properties logging category list, and Universal DDI's own service logs and exported log files. No source URL was supplied for this pass, unlike the other three vendors below - add one if/when available."
